00:22:48.620 --> 00:22:52.130
You have to use ours taxids because those
are the ones we've assigned to the sequences.

00:22:52.130 --> 00:22:57.850
Whether or not that is a true classification
is open for debate but I'm not sure if that

00:22:57.850 --> 00:22:59.000
